        "content": "<h3>AI layer for extensions</h3><p>A shared connection for your own AI features.</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://github.com/netresearch/t3x-nr-llm\">Netresearch · nr-llm</a></li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/b13/aim\">b13 · AiM (Alpha)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://docs.typo3.org/p/nitsan/ns-t3af/main/en-us/Index.html\">NITSAN / T3Planet · AI Foundation</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.louis.info/leistungen/technologien/typo3-extensions/\">LOUIS INTERNET · LIA Middleware AI</a> (For extensions and custom development · commercial)</li></ul>",
